                       "description":  "The State Explorer presents a history of past state exploration runs associated with the selected workflow run. Each exploration represents a point-in-time capture of the target application\u0027s UI state. Users browse this history to find specific exploration runs, understand the progression of state changes across the workflow, and select individual explorations for detailed review. The history view is the entry point for all state analysis.",
